Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《暮光之城4：破晓（下）》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们有着同样的体温\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the same temperature now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:20.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Bella,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在比我更为强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're a lot stronger than I am right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要把我给揉碎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your turn not to break me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾妮斯梅呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renesmee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:04:57.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪里? 我要去看看她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she? I have to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须先控制好自己对血的渴求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get your thirst under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你还得去猎食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you'll need to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上你的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:01.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉 不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉 停下来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我没想到在这荒山野岭里 还会有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I didn't realize there'd be people this far from the trails.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我可以帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者不用我帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真让我惊叹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm amazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能够在猎食人血的途中抽身离去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ran away from human blood mid-hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:11.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是成熟的吸血鬼 还无法做到这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even mature vampires have problems with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有想到你还是那么地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't expect you to seem so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一如既往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了这诡异的瞳孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for the creepy eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会保持距离的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would keep my distance for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了宝宝的安全 得先看一下你是如何与我相处的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's safer for the baby to see how you do with me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你啥时候开始在乎蕾妮斯梅了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when do you care about Renesmee?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸一口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a whiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:04.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我现在明白大家讨论的是什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can see what everyone's been talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布 你身上确实有股臭味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake, you really do stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:16.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去真的很般配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}really look great together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:22.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想过来看看我们的女儿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want to come meet our daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.49,0:09:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉 你看上去精神翊翊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look amazing, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在这里等着见你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's been waiting to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露丝 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她向你展示了她对你的最初记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She showed you the first memory she has of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向我展示? 怎么做到的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showed me? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是我是如何能读到别人的想法?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I hear thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝是如何能够预见未来的呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does Alice see the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她天赋异禀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的只离开了两天吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only been out for two days?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的生长速度 相当之快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her growth rate is unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 今天就先到此为止吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. That's enough experimenting for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:10:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她适应得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 但我们也不要逼得太紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Let's not push it though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么一回事啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:10.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉她吧 雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do tell her, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉 你听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是狼人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a wolf thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么狼人的事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a wolf thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.89,0:11:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这是我们无法控制的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know we have no control over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也无法选择发生的对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't choose who it happens with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且事情不是你想的那样 贝拉 我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it doesn't mean what you think, Bella. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把蕾妮斯梅带出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Renesmee out of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:40.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德华 现在不要碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward, don't touch me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想伤到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:51.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然给我女儿打下狼族印记?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You imprinted on my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是逼不得已!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't my choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她只是个婴儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:55.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真是这样 你觉得爱德华会饶了我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think Edward would let me live if it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在仍半信半疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still debating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.51,0:12:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只抱过她一次!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've held her once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一次 雅各布!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One time, Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你就认为自己可以对她宣示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And already you think that you have some moronic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓的狼人所有权了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wolfy claim on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的女儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:16.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine, Leah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须离她远远的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna stay away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这点我无法做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德华 拦住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop her, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说了没关系啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很了不起 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得自己在三天前 是有多希望我能陪在你身边吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember how much you wanted to be around me 3 days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此情不在了 是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's gone now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就消逝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:38.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为其实是她需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it was her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从一开始 希望我能在场的就是尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the beginning it was Nessie who wanted me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 尼斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nessie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还给我女儿取了个外号 叫尼斯湖怪物?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You nicknamed my daughter after the Loch Ness monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞斯 你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seth, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞斯 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seth, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比任何人都更了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know me better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想要小尼斯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is for Ness...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾妮斯梅能够安全幸福地成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renesmee to be safe. Happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:24.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从前的那些事情 让人百思不解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing ever made sense before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 我 以及这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. Me. Any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而现在我知道原因了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因在于她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于都来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轮到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她睡在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does she sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡在我怀里 或是爱德华和爱斯梅的怀里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my arms. Or Edward's or Esme's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从三天前开始 年纪就不再长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stopped aging three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:32.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我们就是要庆祝 所以你就忍着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're celebrating anyway. So suck it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是讨厌惊喜 这一点并没有变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still hate surprises. That hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会喜欢这个惊喜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll love this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎到家!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想着 你们俩应该想要一个自己的小窝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought you guys might like a place of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:14:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得非常棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.27,0:15:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你们愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是蕾妮斯梅的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will be Renesmee's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衣柜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是爱丽丝为你购置的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice stocked it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显而易见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸血鬼不睡觉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires don't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是用来睡觉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not intended for sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前确实在克制着自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really were holding back before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:18:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定会要不够你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never gonna get enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我们不会累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不用休息 不用喘气 还不用吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to rest or catch our breath or eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:11.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么停得下来啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how are we gonna stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗莎莉和埃米特就很缠绵 足足十年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosalie and Emmett were so bad, it took a solid decade
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才能受得了站在他们身旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before we could stand to be within five miles of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们会更缠绵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we might be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做完了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾妮斯梅在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Renesmee?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被那个金发妞偷走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blondie stole her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们弄坏了不少的东西吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break a lot of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃米特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:18:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是查理打来的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他每天都来电两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been calling twice a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在很憔悴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in pretty rough shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们最终还是得告诉他 你没有活过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually, we'll have to tell him you didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能让他哀痛 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs to mourn, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们明天再告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. We'll do it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会想念这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna miss this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会回来的 向来都如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll come back. We always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人说过离开一事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody said anything about leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:52.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当大家都相信贝拉病逝了 我们就不能让她曝光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once people believe Bella's dead, we can't risk anyone seeing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.77,0:19:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你们就这样消失?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布 我们也是迫不得已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, we don't have another choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有听到什么消息吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉她...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:50.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 她没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 我是说 她挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, I mean, she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.34,0:20:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她回到家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's back home and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且状态好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你刚才怎么不说? 这就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you say so? That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有件事情你必须先了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something you need to see first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去见贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to see Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让贝拉好转 她必须\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order for Bella to get better, she had to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"转化" 这是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "change"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别误解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.50,0:21:35.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是要干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所处的世界 其实并不是你想的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't live in the world you think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布 快把衣服穿上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, put your clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也许看上去很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this may seem strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:49.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很奇怪 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really strange. But
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都有更奇怪的事情发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stranger things happen every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把问题解决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I solved a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们却要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.87,0:22:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还要我怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you expect me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.41,0:22:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本没有意识到 你让他陷入险境之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't realize the danger you've put him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族会把发现我们身份的人类都杀掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Volturi will kill anyone who knows about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我没有把你的身份告诉他 我只说了我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't tell him about you. Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:22.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只说了你和别人不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only said you were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说我们还收养了一个侄女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that we have a niece who we adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的 雅各布 他肯定还会继续追问的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, seriously, Jake, he's not just gonna let that go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你考虑过他会给贝拉带来多大的痛苦吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you consider the physical pain he'll put Bella through?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就像是把热烙铁直接插她的喉咙里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be like sticking a white hot branding iron down her throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.56,0:22:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如她要竭力控制自己对血的欲望那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's assuming she can control her thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查理现在非常痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Charlie's been in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 有他在你的生活里 你会过得更幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know you'll be much happier with him in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布 你别装得好像是为别人好 其实你是为了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, don't try and pretend you're doing this for anyone but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.61,0:22:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 会让你有这种看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry you feel that way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.45,0:22:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他十分钟后就到这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he'll be here in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.57,0:22:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:51.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的眼睛刚开始会有点不适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These will irritate your eyes at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.87,0:22:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关键在于不要移动得太快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The main thing is not to move too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试着去那边坐下 双腿交叉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try taking a seat. Crossing your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.38,0:23:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许还应该再慢一点 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a tad slower. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.09,0:23:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每分钟最起码眨眼三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And blink at least three times a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.27,0:23:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡通人物才这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a cartoon character.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屏住呼吸 有助于控制对血的渴求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your breath. It will help with the thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是要记住耸肩 这会让你看上去就像是在呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't forget to move your shoulders so it looks like you're breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.20,0:23:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 别坐得太直\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't sit so straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的坐姿不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我掌握住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.41,0:23:40.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走动 眨眼 耷拉着身子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move around, blink, slouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.06,0:23:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.82,0:24:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:16.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.91,0:24:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.70,0:24:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,壮如小马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Healthy as a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.88,0:25:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该不会也能变身成为动物吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't turn into an animal, too, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.55,0:25:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她倒是想有那么厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wishes she was that awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.39,0:25:19.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们单独聊聊吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give them some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.74,0:25:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布说这是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Jake said that this...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.24,0:25:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是必需的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.21,0:25:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的觉得 你还是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really think it would be better...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.75,0:25:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道你出了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.21,0:25:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该给我个解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I deserve an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.80,0:25:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.97,0:25:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你真要知道 那我就不能留在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you really need one, I can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托! 别这样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.64,0:25:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再离开了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more going away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.39,0:26:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸 你只需相信 不管怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you're just gonna have to trust that for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确实很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm more than all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.44,0:26:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能接受这个说法吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you live with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.31,0:26:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能否接受这个说法?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I live with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.57,0:26:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't know, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.61,0:26:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲眼目睹了 一个自己从小看到大的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I just watched a kid I've known his entire life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.28,0:26:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变身成为大狼狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turn into a very large dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.08,0:26:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我的女儿 看上去像是我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daughter looks like my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.91,0:26:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实不然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.46,0:26:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以相信我吗 我会把你需要知道的事情都告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you please just believe that I'll tell you anything that you need to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这事是我不需要知道的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't need to know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.47,0:26:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.97,0:26:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 你不用知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.93,0:26:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.14,0:26:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再失去你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not gonna lose you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.15,0:26:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承受不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.53,0:26:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.49,0:26:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you, Bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.63,0:27:20.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.14,0:27:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸 我也想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.69,0:27:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.90,0:27:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是蕾妮斯梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Renesmee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.70,0:27:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的侄女?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your niece?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.87,0:27:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.37,0:27:50.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.87,0:27:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The adoption.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.21,0:27:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫蕾妮斯梅?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renee-semee?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.55,0:28:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她遗传了你的眼睛 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got your eyes, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.44,0:28:15.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想 这是我需要知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need to know, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.83,0:28:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.33,0:28:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从未见过新生吸血鬼 能有这般自制力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never seen a newborn show that kind of restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.09,0:28:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不确定她是不是新生吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure she is a newborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在如此乏味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's so tame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:42.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃米特 你不要惹她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett, don't antagonize her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.76,0:28:44.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是全屋子里最强大的一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the strongest one in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.51,0:28:46.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.94,0:28:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃米特 不要弄伤自己哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt yourself, Emmett.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.77,0:28:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 数到三开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. On 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.28,0:29:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.53,0:29:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.32,0:29:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.59,0:29:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.97,0:29:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.16,0:29:55.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我作为人类的时光已经结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My time as a human was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.83,0:29:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我却觉得现在更有活力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I never felt more alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.92,0:30:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我生来就适合成为吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born to be a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.23,0:30:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切皆尘埃落定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything was falling into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.69,0:30:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连沃尔图里家族 似乎也接受了我的新身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the Volturi seemed to accept my new status.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.74,0:30:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管他们最终仍需证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though they'd want proof eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.58,0:30:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 我们似乎仅存一个敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seemed we had only one enemy left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.54,0:30:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.12,0:30:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾妮斯梅长得太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renesmee was growing too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.59,0:30:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都担心还能与她相处多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all worried about how long we would have with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.84,0:30:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这使得每一分每一秒 都倍感珍贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just made every moment more precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.39,0:30:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 是雪花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, a snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.72,0:30:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.56,0:30:56.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不如再去接一朵?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go get another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.94,0:31:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德华认为我们能在巴西找到这些事情的答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward thinks that we'll find answers in Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.86,0:31:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有些部落 或许对此有所了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are tribes there that might know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.63,0:31:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那人是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.80,0:31:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她应该是我们在德纳里的堂亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's our cousin from Denali.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.60,0:31:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊丽娜!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.87,0:32:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔尼娅说服伊丽娜来与我们和解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanya convinced Irina to come reconcile with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.42,0:32:02.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她似乎改变了主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like she changed her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.17,0:32:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到雅各布也在 她肯定觉得难以接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seeing Jacob must have been too much for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.75,0:32:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望我能跟她谈一谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wish I could have just spoken to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.71,0:32:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是亲戚 会适应过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's family. She'll come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.29,0:33:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让人喜出望外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.88,0:33:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.88,0:33:35.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来举报一项罪行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to report a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.26,0:33:38.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柯伦一家...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cullens...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.93,0:33:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们做了一些可怕的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've done something terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.23,0:33:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请允许我 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.33,0:34:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 爱丽丝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.12,0:34:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.79,0:34:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正冲着我们而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.29,0:34:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有阿罗 凯厄斯 马库斯 护卫队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro, Caius, Marcus, the Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.17,0:34:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及伊丽娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Irina.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.38,0:34:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.72,0:34:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.13,0:34:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊丽娜在林子里看到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did Irina see in the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.34,0:35:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们当时只是在散步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were just walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.30,0:35:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小尼斯则与雪花嬉戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ness was catching snowflakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.64,0:35:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就难怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.65,0:35:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊丽娜认为蕾妮斯梅是吸血鬼幼童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina thinks Renesmee's an Immortal Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.15,0:35:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸血鬼幼童都长得很俊俏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Immortal Children were very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.70,0:35:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,极其迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So enchanting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.95,0:35:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要接近他们 就会爱上他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be near them was to love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.99,0:35:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是当他们变成吸血鬼 便会停止生长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But their development was frozen at the age they were turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.50,0:35:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们无法被教导 或者被限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They couldn't be taught or restrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.04,0:35:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便发个脾气 便足以摧毁整个村庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A single tantrum could destroy an entire village.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.80,0:35:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类听说了这起毁灭性的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans heard about the devastation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.72,0:35:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流言四起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stories spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.51,0:35:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族被迫插手其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Volturi were forced to intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.69,0:35:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为孩子们无法保守我们的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since the Children couldn't protect our secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.15,0:35:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只能把他们处置了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they had to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.41,0:36:04.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.74,0:36:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.20,0:36:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.71,0:36:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创造者对他们极其疼爱 并竭力保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their creators grew very attached and fought to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.26,0:36:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而长期以来建立的族系 就此被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long-established covens were torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.67,0:36:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无数的人类 惨遭杀戮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Countless humans slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.35,0:36:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传统 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traditions, friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.43,0:36:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至家人 皆凋敝零落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even families. Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.56,0:36:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.39,0:36:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈!  - 不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mother!  - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.56,0:36:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.03,0:36:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以德纳里的妈妈 创造了一个吸血鬼幼童?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the Denalis' mother made an Immortal Child?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.90,0:36:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.78,0:36:44.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她为此付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she paid the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.43,0:37:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾妮斯梅和这些孩子可不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Renesmee's nothing like those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.47,0:37:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她生来如此 并不是被咬所致 而且她每天都在生长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was born, not bitten. She grows every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:15.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能向沃尔图里解释这种情况吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So can't you just explain that to the Volturi?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.77,0:37:17.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿罗从伊丽娜的思维中 得到足够的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro has enough proof in Irina's thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.07,0:37:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就抗争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.28,0:37:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的进攻武器过于强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their offensive weapons are too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.07,0:37:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都无法与简抗衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can stand against Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.95,0:37:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而亚历克更加厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alec's even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.00,0:37:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就说服他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then we convince them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.83,0:37:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是来杀我们 而不是来谈话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming to kill us, not to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.46,0:37:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.46,0:37:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会听我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't listen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.42,0:37:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也许其他人能够说服他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But maybe others can convince them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.84,0:37:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 你的朋友遍布全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle, you have friends all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.93,0:37:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能叫他们一起来抗争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't ask them to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.34,0:37:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必抗争 只需作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not fight. Witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.30,0:37:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有足够的人了解到真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If enough people knew the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.35,0:37:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们可以说服沃尔图里家族听我们解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe we could convince the Volturi to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.14,0:37:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一点 我们可以请求朋友们的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can ask this of our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.82,0:38:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我们又可以去伦敦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least we get to go to London again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.95,0:38:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经很久没有去那里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't been there in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.83,0:38:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们赶紧上路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Let's get this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.21,0:38:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝叫我把这个给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice asked me to give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.34,0:38:25.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和贾斯珀昨晚闯进我们的领地 往海那边去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She and Jasper crossed our lands to the ocean last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:28.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.64,0:38:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们离开了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.51,0:38:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.06,0:38:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没有说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.48,0:38:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我看看吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.86,0:38:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在开始积雪之前 尽可能地多召集证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gather as many witnesses as you can before the snow sticks to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.70,0:38:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会在那个时候到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when they'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.02,0:38:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(《威尼斯商人》  威廉·莎士比亚)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.50,0:38:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝的指示很清楚 但仍存疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice's instructions were clear, but the question remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.37,0:39:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么在我们最需要他们的时候 她和贾斯珀却离开了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would she and Jasper leave at the moment we needed them most?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.04,0:39:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们知道些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.84,0:39:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一路向北 去拜访我们的近亲 以此开启了寻求证人之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our search for witnesses began with a trip north to our closest relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.55,0:39:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德华 一切可好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward, is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.42,0:39:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么不告诉我们 你们要来啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell us you were coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.80,0:39:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为伊丽娜吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it Irina?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.43,0:39:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有她的消息吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you heard from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.60,0:39:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是听别人说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:39:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你的新娘在车上等?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is your bride waiting in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.39,0:39:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 为什么还带了头狼与你们同行?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why have you brought a wolf with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.89,0:40:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里就能闻到他的臭味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can smell him from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.56,0:40:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家族身处险境 我需要你们的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family is in danger. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.56,0:40:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.94,0:40:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这实在难以解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard to explain
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.98,0:40:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我需要你能够摒除偏见 可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I need you to be open-minded. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.11,0:40:09.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.83,0:40:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.58,0:40:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候去见一些新面孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to meet some new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.12,0:40:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们不喜欢我怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they don't like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.75,0:40:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们会喜欢你的  - 他们会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They'll love you.  - They will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.21,0:40:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要他们了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once they understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.58,0:40:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们只是从未见过像你这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just haven't met anyone like you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.42,0:40:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.73,0:40:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃尔图里会把我们都杀掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Volturi will come for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.73,0:40:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把那东西带离这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get that thing out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.23,0:40:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的本质是不一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not what she looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.44,0:40:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是一种罪行!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a crime!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.79,0:41:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.29,0:41:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的血管里 有鲜血在流动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has blood in her veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以感受到她的温度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can feel her warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.46,0:41:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能感觉得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.67,0:41:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是她的亲生父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm her biological father.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.88,0:41:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 贝拉是她的母亲  - 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bella is her mother.  - Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.92,0:41:12.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千真万确 她出生在我还是人类的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true. She was born while I was still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.68,0:41:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是闻所未闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never heard of such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.26,0:41:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意 她可以展示给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can show you, if you let her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.18,0:41:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔尼娅 这是你欠我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanya, you owe us this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.98,0:41:25.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你的妹妹不让我们解释 而给我们招致杀身大祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all under a death sentence because your sister didn't let us explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.32,0:41:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.32,0:41:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是她沟通的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how she communicates.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.38,0:41:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.01,0:41:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.56,0:42:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道其他族人也会感到同样的畏惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew the rest of our family would face this fear as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.35,0:42:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畏惧着未知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear of the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.15,0:42:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畏惧着沃尔图里家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear of the Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.08,0:42:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿蒙 求你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amun, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.04,0:42:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 我帮不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot help you, Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.29,0:42:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是事态紧急 我也不会求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't ask if it weren't urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.60,0:42:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿闻其详\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.68,0:42:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没见过阿蒙的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never get to meet any of Amun's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.98,0:42:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他喜欢把我藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He likes to keep me hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得没必要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine why.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.87,0:43:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是卡莱尔  - 我是本杰明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carlisle.  - Benjamin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.81,0:43:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本杰明可以改变各种元素的形态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benjamin can influence the elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.32,0:43:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我拥有超凡的自控力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here I get super self-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.88,0:44:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.93,0:44:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是塞纳和扎弗里娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senna and Zafrina.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.89,0:44:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自亚马逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.19,0:44:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞纳和扎弗里娜的到来 意味着即便是世上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The arrival of Senna and Zafrina meant that our plea was being heard
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.86,0:44:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最偏远的角落 也听说了我们的诉求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in even the most remote corners of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.45,0:44:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且其他人则在寻找邻近的证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while others searched for witnesses closer to home.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.89,0:44:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.04,0:44:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔与一名爱国者的初见 是在约克城的战场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A patriot Carlisle first met on the battlefield at Yorktown
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.04,0:44:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他将会成为我们最意外的同盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would become our most unlikely ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.63,0:44:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.22,0:44:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我痛恨英国的第一次入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hated the first British Invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.55,0:44:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是第二次入侵更让人痛恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I hate the second one even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.31,0:44:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连披头士乐队也讨厌?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the Beatles?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.52,0:44:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧 加勒特?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, Garrett?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.10,0:44:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旧习难改啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old habits die hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.19,0:44:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.82,0:45:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.24,0:45:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.40,0:45:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我要先把晚饭给吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first I'd better finish my meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.74,0:45:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命! 救命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.33,0:45:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个人都被说服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each of them was won over.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.46,0:45:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个人都得以亲证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each was made to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.68,0:45:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔说服了他在爱尔兰的朋友到福克斯一游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle convinced his Irish friends to make the journey to Forks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.81,0:45:32.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我们很感激他们的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although we were grateful for their help,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.94,0:45:35.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他们对人血的渴求 使得情况复杂化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their thirst for human blood complicated the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.28,0:45:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而罗莎莉和埃米特带来的游牧民 更是深不可测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nomads Rosalie and Emmett sent were even more unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.37,0:45:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially Peter
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.70,0:45:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自成为新生吸血鬼之时 就一直与贾斯珀打斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who had fought alongside Jasper as a newborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.00,0:45:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都是血红的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lotta red eyes around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.91,0:45:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们同意不在这一区域猎食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They agreed not to hunt in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.67,0:46:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们会在其他地方吸血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they'll feed somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.97,0:46:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随着越来越多的吸血鬼踏足到他们的领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As more vampires set foot in their territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.63,0:46:06.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越来越多的奎尔尤特族人开始变身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more Quileutes turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.05,0:46:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的天性 迫使他们加入狼群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their nature compelling them to join the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.22,0:46:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 别激动 嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, easy there. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.56,0:46:15.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.35,0:46:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.44,0:46:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后 卡莱尔和爱斯梅与我们最后一名证人 一同归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally, Carlisle and Esme returned with our last witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.41,0:46:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来了多少人?  - 十八个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many came?  - Eighteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.91,0:46:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确实有些好朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have some good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.66,0:46:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝有消息吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.87,0:46:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在都成了阿罗的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll all be on Aro's list now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.00,0:46:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃了几个世纪 你们给我招惹了这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Centuries on the run. That's what you've brought me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.84,0:46:42.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的朋友 卡莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some friend, Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.13,0:46:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚力斯泰尔 来跟大家打个招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alistair, come meet everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.84,0:46:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经跟你说过 如果要战斗 我是不会和沃尔图里作对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already told you, if it comes to a fight, I won't stand against the Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.14,0:46:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会打起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't come to a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.26,0:46:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去阁楼呆着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.52,0:47:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他习惯独来独往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a people person.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.74,0:47:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家迎来了十八个吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We opened our home to 18 vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.86,0:47:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们各有各的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many with gifts of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.37,0:47:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扎弗里娜拥有影响思维的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zafrina had power over the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.16,0:47:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让你看到任何她想要你看的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She could make anyone see what she wanted them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.11,0:47:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是她握着我的手 我会以为眼前这些是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she weren't holding my hand right now, I could swear this was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.99,0:47:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么也看不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.32,0:47:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德华 你没有告诉我 你的妻子是防护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward, you didn't tell me your wife is a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.25,0:47:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是防护盾?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.50,0:48:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不同于我认识的那些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones I've met are so different.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.00,0:48:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一种防御性的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a defensive talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.42,0:48:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我无法读到你的思维 即使是在从前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's why I couldn't read your mind, even before.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.59,0:48:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而阿罗也无法看穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's why Aro couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.97,0:48:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拥有非常强大的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a very powerful gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.01,0:48:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 她是防护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, she's a shield, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.35,0:48:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还想着给她吃点苦头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoulda put her on her ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.93,0:48:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者是你的电力其实没那么厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or your voltage has been exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.93,0:48:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许它只在弱者身上起效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it only works on the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.48,0:48:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加勒特 别惹她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garrett, I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.61,0:48:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个了不起的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are an amazing woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.20,0:48:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们现在的破坏力极强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you guys can do some serious damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.04,0:48:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你们必须控制自己的变身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why you'll need to control your phasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.58,0:48:47.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不想在一怒之下 就扯掉了自己妈妈的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your mom pisses you off, you don't want to tear her head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.26,0:48:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管来者是何人 都并未受到邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever's coming wasn't invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.89,0:49:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜呼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoopa!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.82,0:49:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是弗拉基米尔和斯特凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vladimir, Stefan,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.53,0:49:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们离家千里啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're a long way from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.41,0:49:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来这里干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.12,0:50:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们听说沃尔图里一族 正前来对付你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We heard the Volturi were moving against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.83,0:50:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你们并不是人单势孤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that you would not stand alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.00,0:50:04.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们并没有犯下那些罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't do what we were accused of.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.67,0:50:07.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 我们不在乎你们做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not care what you did, Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.63,0:50:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经等了一千年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been waiting a millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.21,0:50:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着这群意大利败类被人挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the Italian scum to be challenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.38,0:50:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们并不打算与沃尔图里对决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not our plan to fight the Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.64,0:50:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.51,0:50:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿罗的证人将会非常失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro's witnesses will be so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.35,0:50:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们很喜欢激烈的打斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They enjoy a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.98,0:50:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿罗的证人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro's witnesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.35,0:50:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.69,0:50:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还期盼着他们会听你们的解释?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still hoping they'll listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.57,0:50:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但阿罗看中了其他家族的某个人之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Aro wants someone from a coven
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.11,0:50:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不了多久 就能找到证据去证明这个家庭确实有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's never long before evidence turns up proving that coven committed some crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.24,0:50:40.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以前就做过这种事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's done this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.87,0:50:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很少 我都没意识到这是一种惯例了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happens so rarely, I never realized it was a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.16,0:50:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然他总会宽恕那些被他称为有悔改之心的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently he always pardons one person whose thoughts he claims are repentant.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.13,0:50:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这种人 通常都具备特殊能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This person always has an ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.59,0:50:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会在护卫队中占有一席之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they're always given a place with the Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.88,0:50:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是冲着爱丽丝来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all about Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.92,0:50:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他那里没有人拥有她的这种能力  - 所以她才离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He has no one like her.  - Which is why she left.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.51,0:50:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他为什么需要证人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does he need witnesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.01,0:51:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是为了散播正义得到伸张的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To spread the word that justice has been served.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.26,0:51:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他屠杀了整个族系之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After he slaughters an entire coven.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.44,0:51:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本杰明 蒂亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benjamin, Tia,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.19,0:51:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧  - 你们能去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- we're leaving.  - And where will you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.77,0:51:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为 他们得到爱丽丝之后就会满足?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think they'll be satisfied with Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.69,0:51:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难保本杰明就是他们下一个要抓的对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's to stop them from going after Benjamin next?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.99,0:51:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又或者是扎弗里娜 或是凯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or Zafrina or Kate
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.24,0:51:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是其他有才能的人? 只要是被他们看中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or anyone else with a gift? Anyone they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.32,0:51:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的目的并不在于惩戒 而是能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their goal isn't punishment, it's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.03,0:51:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了获取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's acquisition.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.70,0:51:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔也许不会请求你们加入战斗 但我会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle might not ask you to fight, but I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.33,0:51:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了我家人的安危 但也是为了你们自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the sake of my family. But also for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.25,0:51:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了你们想要的生活方式而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for the way you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.30,0:51:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼族愿意加入战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The packs will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.47,0:51:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从不害怕吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've never been afraid of vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.48,0:51:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会加入战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.64,0:51:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也不是我第一次对抗国王的统治了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This won't be the first time I fought a king's rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.15,0:51:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会加入你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.61,0:51:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.99,0:51:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿蒙 我要做正确的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do the right thing, Amun.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.11,0:52:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也可以做你自己想做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.08,0:52:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会与你们并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will stand with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.49,0:52:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So will we.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.92,0:52:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人不也多嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That didn't take much.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.67,0:52:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但愿不会开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hope it doesn't come to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.92,0:52:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.60,0:52:28.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都表现出勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone showed courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.02,0:52:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我们知道 阿罗的大军正朝我们赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though we knew that Aro's army was moving against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.77,0:52:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快 我们就要面对简的黑暗力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon we would face the dark gifts of Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.61,0:52:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更可怕的是 她的弟弟释放出来的麻痹气体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And worse, the paralyzing vapor of her brother Alec
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.44,0:52:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会让人失去视觉 听觉 以及触觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who could rob you of sight, sound and touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.05,0:53:00.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒绝了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I refused him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.38,0:53:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒绝了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I refused him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.84,0:53:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会支持卡莱尔的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not with Carlisle!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.23,0:53:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚历克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alec?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.79,0:53:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝不会与你作对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will never go against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.58,0:53:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.92,0:53:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的敏郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my dear Toshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.23,0:54:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎卡莱尔仍在等着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems Carlisle is still expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.87,0:54:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔现在也是自身难保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle is all but ensuring his own destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.29,0:54:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.38,0:54:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.92,0:54:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在阿罗进攻之前 他会希望夺去我们的作战能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro will want us incapacitated before he attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.05,0:54:27.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而简和亚历克会想办法先把我弄出去 因为我能看透他们的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jane and Alec will try and take me out first because I can anticipate their moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.80,0:54:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜我们没有你那种防护能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad we don't all have your shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.22,0:54:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这对我的战斗并无帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't help me fight, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.93,0:54:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你可以帮我们大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but you could help the rest of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.14,0:54:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能够放射出防护能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you could project it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.43,0:54:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此话怎讲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.64,0:54:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了防护你自己 也防护其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean shield someone other than yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.23,0:54:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.40,0:54:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能力经过一段时间 是可以发展的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gifts can be developed. Over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.48,0:54:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的电力 一开始只存在于掌心之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At first, mine was just in my palms.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.73,0:54:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而现在我可以把它辐射到全身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I can radiate it all over my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.90,0:54:46.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.82,0:54:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 告诉我  - 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me.  - Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.99,0:54:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须对它进行设想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to visualize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.83,0:54:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看它是如何移动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See how it moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.25,0:54:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是什么颜色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What color it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.88,0:55:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 用意念想象着它在扩张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now picture it expanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.00,0:55:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让它从你体内释放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will it to go beyond you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.85,0:55:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得她需要一点动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she needs something to motivate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.86,0:55:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 没关系 我能承受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No.  - It's all right, I can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.20,0:55:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是他说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.70,0:55:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉 集中注意力 否则他会受伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus, Bella, or he's gonna be hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.62,0:55:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德华 我还没有准备好去应对这情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward, I'm not ready to do this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.50,0:55:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我说了我还没有准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I said that I wasn't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.46,0:55:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄 你并没有给她动力啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you're not motivating her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.04,0:55:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要试一试吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.39,0:55:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯特!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kate!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.97,0:55:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你似乎缺乏刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to lack incentive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.68,0:55:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我去看看蕾妮斯梅醒了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I go see if Renesmee's awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.85,0:56:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.40,0:56:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.52,0:56:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次是贯注了全部力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's on full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.68,0:56:41.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点痛 但是可以承受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's painful, but it's bearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.15,0:56:49.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我们应该再试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we should go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.36,0:56:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃米特 你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.70,0:56:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.66,0:56:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜美音乐缓缓而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There's sweet music here that"
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.28,0:57:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柔若玫瑰花瓣落入草丛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"softer falls than petals from blown roses on the grass."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.96,0:57:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涧边石墙水珠凝集\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Or night dews on still waters between walls"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.88,0:57:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜露微光轻闪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"of shadowy granite in a gleaming pass."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.09,0:57:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阵阵天籁 伴你进入甜蜜梦乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Music that brings sweet sleep down from the blissful skies."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.98,0:57:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.57,0:57:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.82,0:57:34.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝姑姑和贾斯珀叔叔离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Aunt Alice and Uncle Jasper run away
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为我们快要死了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we're gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.37,0:57:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.21,0:57:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他们离开 是为了让我们更加安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they left to keep us safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.34,0:57:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人也是因为这个原因 而聚在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what all these other people are here for, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.84,0:57:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝不会让任何人伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never let anybody hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.18,0:58:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 安心睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here. Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.08,0:58:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.75,0:58:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得自己体力充沛 足以摧毁一辆坦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Physically, I feel like I could demolish a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.25,0:58:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是精神上却觉得非常疲累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mentally, I just feel drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.51,0:58:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不去泡个澡吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.74,0:59:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还记得怎样给自己脱衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do remember how to undress myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.41,0:59:04.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嘛 可是我脱得比你更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I just do it so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.42,0:59:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.13,0:59:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是习惯性地去低估你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had a bad habit of underestimating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.10,0:59:23.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次你碰到阻碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every obstacle you've faced,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.27,0:59:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都会以为你无法克服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd think you couldn't overcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.60,0:59:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你却克服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.61,0:59:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是给你给了他们奋战的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the reason they have something to fight for.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.90,0:59:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.17,0:59:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去放水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get the water running.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.40,1:00:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(J·詹克斯 西雅图 看后即毁)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.83,1:00:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝确保只有我能够看到这个信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice made sure only I would get the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.67,1:00:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为只有我的想法 是阿罗无法读到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because only my mind would be safe from Aro.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.80,1:00:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然愿意暂停魔鬼训练 真让我意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised you took a break from Jedi training.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.85,1:00:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我不把蕾妮斯梅带去我爸家 他会来找我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't take Renesmee to my dad, he'll come to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.19,1:00:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有27个吸血鬼 1个人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}27 vampires, one human.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.36,1:00:55.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so great.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.52,1:00:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这是你对爱德华的说辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that's what you told Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.20,1:01:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.70,1:01:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是很高兴能够远离那些臭死人的吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just glad to get away from all those reeking bloodsuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.66,1:01:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.21,1:01:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.71,1:01:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.09,1:01:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But come on,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.42,1:01:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸血鬼德拉库拉一代和二代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dracula One and Two are
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.93,1:01:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都很惊悚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}creepy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.90,1:01:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她到了 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she is. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.78,1:01:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.40,1:01:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇! 瞧瞧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.91,1:01:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又长高了半英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've grown half a foot!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.91,1:01:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.58,1:01:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长高了六英寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like 6 inches.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.12,1:01:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来吧 午饭做好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on inside. Lunch is on the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.92,1:01:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有圣诞树要装饰呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a tree to decorate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.54,1:01:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我还有些事情要办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've actually got a few errands to run, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.38,1:01:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上回来 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.88,1:02:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 我们进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.52,1:02:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝的便笺 带给我新的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice's note gave me a new sense of hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.60,1:02:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许她最后还是能够帮我们想出办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe she had a plan for us after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.77,1:02:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许这个J·詹克斯就是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe J. Jenks was the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.63,1:02:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是来找詹克斯先生的  - 请跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm meeting Mr. Jenks.  - Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.14,1:02:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 柯伦太太  - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mrs. Cullen.  - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.56,1:02:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴你能够来电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so happy you called.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.57,1:03:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是在这里与我的私人客户会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always meet my private clients here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.16,1:03:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里比办公室更自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more comfortable than the office.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.95,1:03:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且更为大庭广众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's more public.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.20,1:03:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.70,1:03:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问你是做什么工作的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What type of work do you do, J.?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.75,1:03:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 就是一些琐事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you know, this and that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.17,1:03:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各不相同 所以很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always different, which keeps it interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.09,1:03:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识爱丽丝和贾斯珀很久了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you known Alice and Jasper long?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.01,1:03:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经为他们服务了二十多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been working with them for more than 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.43,1:03:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已故的搭档 在此之前已经认识贾斯珀十五年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my late partner knew Jasper 15 years before that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.39,1:03:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.23,1:03:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保养得非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unusually well-preserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.31,1:03:42.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.15,1:03:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信贾斯珀先生很享受自己的假期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust that Mr. Jasper is enjoying his vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.41,1:03:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他并没有告诉你他去了哪里 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't tell you where he was going, did he?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.74,1:03:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 他过来下订单的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, he just mentioned that he was leaving
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.91,1:03:58.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只提到自己要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he came by to place his order.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.08,1:04:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想 他的订单已经准备好了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume that his order is ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.13,1:04:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.13,1:04:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我送东西 从来都是很准时的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been late with a delivery.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.23,1:04:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.28,1:04:31.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.24,1:04:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是我和我丈夫以为 我们大家会一起去旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband and I thought that we'd all be traveling together.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.66,1:04:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾斯珀说出行的只有两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jasper said only two were traveling.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.70,1:04:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的指示说得非常明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His instructions were very clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.46,1:04:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.59,1:04:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然 这是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, that's not going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.82,1:05:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝预见得非常清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice's vision was clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.74,1:05:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾妮斯梅会有未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renesmee would have a future.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.58,1:05:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我和爱德华并没有参与在内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Edward and I wouldn't be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.00,1:05:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How ya doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.02,1:05:48.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最亲爱的蕾妮斯梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"My dearest Renesmee,"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.19,1:05:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我原以为 我们可以永远在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I thought we would have forever together."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.07,1:05:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这个永远 并不如我所希望的那么长久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"But forever isn't as long as I'd hoped."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.03,1:05:57.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在知道 爱丽丝为何给我留下线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I know now why Alice left me clues."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.74,1:05:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了保你周全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"It was to keep you safe."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.62,1:06:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和雅各布只需要待在狼族里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Everything you and Jacob will need is in this pack."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.08,1:06:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布会保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jacob will protect you."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.13,1:06:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还会帮你了解到图库纳的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And he'll help you learn about the Ticuna legends."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.13,1:06:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是种浪漫的想法 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a romantic notion, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.51,1:06:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认为正义能够以少数 战胜邪恶的多数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That a righteous few can defy a great evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.60,1:06:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须肯定 你让我相信了这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must admit, you even had me believing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.98,1:06:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那么片刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.94,1:06:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运 你会需要用到这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, good luck. You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.03,1:06:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.00,1:06:47.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始积雪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The snow is sticking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.21,1:06:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 我们仍拥有今日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we still have today.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.97,1:06:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴查理身边有人能够照顾他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad Charlie found somebody to take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.10,1:07:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉 大家都没有放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, no one's giving up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.10,1:07:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了! 派礼物啦! 开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Present time! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.81,1:07:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞斯 莉亚 不要吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seth, Leah, stop eating.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.02,1:07:11.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布 你先开始 赶紧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake, you start. Get it going.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.36,1:07:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你给我准备了什么礼物?  - 我什么也不打算算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you get me?  - I'm not giving you anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.53,1:07:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿! 别这样 你给我准备了什么呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! No, come on, what did you get me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.78,1:07:18.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸 我们没有时间包装礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Dad, we didn't have time to wrap yours,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.32,1:07:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是送你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.20,1:07:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是弗雷泽河的五日垂钓航行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a 5-day fishing trip to Fraser River.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.92,1:07:29.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是送给你和苏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for you and Sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.54,1:07:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们明天早上就出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.17,1:07:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 真棒 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that's really nice. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.55,1:07:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天? 我明天可不能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow? I can't leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.09,1:07:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经帮你把工作安排好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made arrangements for you at work.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.34,1:07:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们背着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.10,1:07:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且非常奢侈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.43,1:07:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕这个是不能退钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And non-refundable, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.10,1:07:49.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩是想要甩掉我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two trying to get rid of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.11,1:07:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们确实如愿了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's working!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.44,1:07:57.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗雷泽河 这么说我们可以去追踪海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fraser River. That means we'll be chasing Cutthroat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.53,1:08:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还可能钓到虹鳟鱼或是公海豹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might even hook a Rainbow or some Bulls.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.78,1:08:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人还真是容易知足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woman knows her trout.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.45,1:08:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 真漂亮 让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, beautiful. Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.21,1:08:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是雅各布给你做的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob make this for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.46,1:08:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要戴上吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna put it on?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.59,1:08:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.42,1:08:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.78,1:08:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm talkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.66,1:08:46.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战前的篝火之夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little pre-battle bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.00,1:08:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲一些战争的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Telling war stories.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.25,1:08:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又或者是光站在那边 像是一些怪异的雕塑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or just standing there like freackin' statues.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.09,1:09:02.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便说哪个美国的战役 我都参与了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name any American battle. I was there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.76,1:09:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小巨角战役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.68,1:09:10.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我差一点就咬住了卡斯特将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came this close to biting Custer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.31,1:09:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他被印第安人先抓获了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the Indians got him first.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.81,1:09:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥列格攻打君士坦丁堡时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try Oleg's assault on Constantinople.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.02,1:09:18.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他并不是靠自己打胜仗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't win that one on his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.94,1:09:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要说战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're talking battles,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.32,1:09:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就必须说到十一年战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're talking the Eleven Years' War.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.99,1:09:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从未有人像爱尔兰人那样叛乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one does rebellion like the Irish.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.66,1:09:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们输掉了十一年战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost the Eleven Years' War.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.49,1:09:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 这场叛乱可真是可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye. But it was one hell of a rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.33,1:09:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我们掌权之后 什么事都找上门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we ruled, everything came to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.17,1:09:34.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prey,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.42,1:09:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外交官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}diplomats,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.04,1:09:37.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投机者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}favor seekers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.05,1:09:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我们强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such was our power.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.42,1:09:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们从不给自己戴高帽 也不以圣人自居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we never put on white hats and called ourselves saints.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.18,1:09:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会对自己加以掩饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were honest about what we were.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.06,1:09:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们静坐了好长一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sat still for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.35,1:09:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟未察觉自己已经开始石化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't notice we were beginning to petrify.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.27,1:10:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到沃尔图里家族把我们的城堡烧掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps the Volturi did us a favor when they
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.28,1:10:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许还得感谢他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}burned our castles.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.20,1:10:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经等了一千五百年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been waiting 1,500 years
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.07,1:10:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就为了报这个仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to return that favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.08,1:10:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个世纪以来 我们枕戈待旦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been ready to do battle for ages.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.21,1:10:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不禁去想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't help thinking,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.92,1:10:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人身处险境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all these people are putting themselves in danger
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.55,1:10:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只因我爱上了人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I fell in love with a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.26,1:10:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到了自己的另一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found your mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.76,1:10:24.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deserve to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.26,1:10:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是要付出什么代价?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at what cost?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.80,1:10:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有自己奋战的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone here has something to fight for.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.93,1:10:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然也有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I certainly do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.90,1:10:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 我从未感谢过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle, I've never thanked you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.45,1:10:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给予我这非凡的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For this extraordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.59,1:11:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这代表"比自己的生命更甚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This means "More than my own life."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.51,1:11:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是如此地爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how much I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.47,1:11:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你明天和雅各布待在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow I'm gonna need you to stay with Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.43,1:11:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.98,1:11:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕是我叫他...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if I tell him that...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.82,1:11:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你带离这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That he has to take you somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.28,1:11:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.66,1:11:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.32,1:11:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会平平安安的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.54,1:11:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.38,1:12:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这次我们能够活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we live through this,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.21,1:12:27.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意追随你到天涯海角 女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll follow you anywhere, woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.88,1:12:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总算开口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.99,1:12:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红衫军来了! 红衫军来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Redcoats are coming! The Redcoats are coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.32,1:13:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿罗正在找爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro's looking for Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.33,1:14:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.67,1:14:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们像以往那样 和平议事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let us discuss things as we used to.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.00,1:14:32.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以文明的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a civilized manner.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.67,1:14:34.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得倒是好听 卡莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fair words, Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.55,1:14:36.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但似乎不合时宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a little out of place,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.01,1:14:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你集聚了大军来与我们对抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}given the battalion you've assembled against us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.35,1:14:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证 这并非是我的本意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can promise you, that was never my intent.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.64,1:14:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们并没有违法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No laws have been broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.85,1:14:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看到了那个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We see the child.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.52,1:14:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别以为我们是傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not treat us as fools.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.86,1:14:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是吸血鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is not an Immortal!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.44,1:14:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些证人能够作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These witnesses can attest to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.87,1:14:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者你亲眼瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you can look.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.37,1:15:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧她双颊上的血色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See the flush of human blood in her cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.62,1:15:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诡计!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Artifice!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.00,1:15:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会收集各方面的真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will collect every facet of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.38,1:15:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但作为案件里更关键的人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But from someone more central to the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.55,1:15:13.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.67,1:15:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然这个孩子与你的吸血鬼伴侣有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the child clings to your newborn mate,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.72,1:15:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜 你也牵涉在内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume you are involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.46,1:16:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要见一见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.44,1:17:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.27,1:17:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年轻的贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.65,1:17:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你变得长生不老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immortality becomes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.33,1:17:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到她奇特的心跳声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear her strange heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.73,1:18:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 阿罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Aro.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.24,1:18:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让人惊讶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnifico!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.54,1:18:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一半是凡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half mortal,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.75,1:18:42.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一半是不朽之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}half immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.76,1:18:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都被这个新生儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conceived and carried by this
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.30,1:18:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集于一身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}newborn
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.30,1:18:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当她仍是人类之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while she was still human.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.97,1:18:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.06,1:18:57.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为他们是在骗我吗 弟弟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think they fooled me, brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.82,1:19:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把告发者带上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the informer forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.80,1:19:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到的就是这个孩子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the child you saw?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.30,1:19:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.47,1:19:31.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.97,1:19:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有些变化 这孩子长得更大一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's changed. This child is bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.31,1:19:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你的指控是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then your allegations were false.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.73,1:19:39.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柯伦一家是无辜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cullens are innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.69,1:19:42.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会为自己的错 承担全部责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take full responsibility for my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.53,1:19:47.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.66,1:19:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯厄斯 不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caius, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.50,1:19:57.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊丽娜!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.01,1:20:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们失明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blind them.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.52,1:20:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把视觉还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me my sight back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.06,1:20:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔尼娅 这正好着了他们的道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanya, this is what they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.56,1:20:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你现在发起攻击 我们大家都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you attack now, we'll all die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.59,1:20:47.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.79,1:21:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起作用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.20,1:21:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿罗 我们并没有违法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro, you see there's no law broken here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.50,1:22:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.21,1:22:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是否意味着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But does it then follow
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.79,1:22:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这并不具有危险性呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there is no danger?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.92,1:22:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们史上首次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the first time in our history
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.64,1:22:19.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由人类对我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}humans pose a threat
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.02,1:22:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,产生了威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to our kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.02,1:22:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的现代技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their modern technology
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.64,1:22:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制造出可以摧毁我们的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has given birth to weapons that could destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.78,1:22:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使得保守我们的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maintaining our secret
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.49,1:22:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得更加迫在眉睫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has never been more imperative.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.41,1:22:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这种危险的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In such perilous times,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.66,1:22:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有已知的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only the known
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.33,1:22:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才是安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.21,1:22:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有已知的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the known
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.17,1:22:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才是可接受的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is tolerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们并不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we know nothing
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.17,1:22:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个孩子会变成什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of what this child will become.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.51,1:23:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能够承受这种不确实性吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we live with such uncertainty?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.60,1:23:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日我们免于一战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spare ourselves a fight today,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.36,1:23:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能换来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only to die
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.19,1:23:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明日之死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.24,1:23:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.92,1:23:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.71,1:23:31.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱丽丝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.06,1:23:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲爱的爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear, dear Alice,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.44,1:23:52.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴终于见到你出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're so glad to see you here, after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.90,1:23:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有证据证明这个孩子不会威胁到我们这一族群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have evidence the child won't be a risk to our kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.74,1:23:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我展示给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.66,1:24:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弟弟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.60,1:24:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你并不会在乎我给你看了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter what I show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.44,1:24:31.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕你确实看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even when you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.15,1:24:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都不会改变你的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still won't change your decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.65,1:24:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.91,1:24:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照顾好我的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.50,1:24:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.86,1:25:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.87,1:25:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.54,1:25:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开她!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.28,1:28:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.37,1:28:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.12,1:28:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.21,1:29:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅各布!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.55,1:29:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.63,1:30:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝拉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.61,1:32:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.34,1:34:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.51,1:34:08.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your future.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.06,1:34:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你改变决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you decide on another course.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.89,1:34:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能改变决定 这孩子仍是极大的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot alter our course. The child still poses a grave threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.86,1:34:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果你们能够确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what if you were sure she could
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.11,1:34:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不会在人类的世界里暴露身份呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}remain concealed from the human world?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.40,1:34:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能够和平相处吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could we leave in peace?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.07,1:34:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以 但是我们怎能确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. But that cannot be known.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.07,1:34:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上 可以确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it can.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.90,1:35:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在巴西的图库纳部落中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been searching for witnesses of my own
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.41,1:35:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寻找我自己的证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}among the Ticuna tribes of Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.58,1:35:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们也有足够的证人  - 听他说 弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have enough witnesses.  - Let him speak, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.20,1:35:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是半人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am half human,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.21,1:35:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,半吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}half vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.46,1:35:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像那个孩子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the Child.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.92,1:35:21.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈被吸血鬼给引诱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vampire seduced my mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.13,1:35:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后在生我的时候死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who died giving birth to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.26,1:35:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的阿姨休伊伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My aunt Huilen
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.72,1:35:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲自把我抚养成人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}raised me as her own.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.05,1:35:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把她变成吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made her immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.97,1:35:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在多少岁了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.90,1:35:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,150岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}150 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.11,1:35:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在几岁的时候长大成人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At what age did you reach maturity?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.24,1:35:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我出生后的第七年 我就已经发育完全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I became full-grown seven years after my birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.99,1:35:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我就再也没有改变过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have not changed since then.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.62,1:35:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你都吃些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your diet?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.37,1:35:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.62,1:35:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}human food.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.79,1:36:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两样食物都可以养活我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can survive on either.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.92,1:36:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些孩子和我们很像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These children are much like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.13,1:36:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是柯伦一家与狼人为伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regardless, the Cullens have been consorting with werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.09,1:36:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的天敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our natural enemies.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.61,1:36:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear ones,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.61,1:36:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no danger here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.99,1:36:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will not fight
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.12,1:36:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就今天而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}today.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.19,1:37:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奖品真诱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.32,1:37:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在逃跑 是时候发起攻击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have them on the run. Now is the time to attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.53,1:37:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.12,1:37:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这群笨蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all fools!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.95,1:37:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族或许离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Volturi might be gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.04,1:37:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们绝对不会原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they will never forgive
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.38,1:37:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.06,1:38:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拥有一个美好的家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a beautiful family.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.90,1:38:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会陪着我们好久 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna be around for a long time, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.95,1:38:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.62,1:38:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好有你陪着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad she has you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.67,1:38:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我应该开始叫你"爸爸"吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So should I start calling you "Dad"?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.22,1:38:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.85,1:38:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.52,1:39:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.53,1:39:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 现在我们可以在一起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We're all gonna be together now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.74,1:40:00.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想给你看点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.79,1:40:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.40,1:40:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是爱德华·柯伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Edward Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.29,1:41:35.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.17,1:41:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,练习了好久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been practicing.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.34,1:41:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.89,1:41:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有谁能像我这么地爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's ever loved anybody as much as I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.60,1:41:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一个女人除外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one exception.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.45,1:42:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能再给我看看吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you show me again?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.45,1:42:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有很多的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a lotta time.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.08,1:42:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.46,1:42:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forever.
